# {{org}} — org profile

The org's global answers. Everything here applies to everyone, in every group and every repo. Department knobs live in `groups/<g>/group.md`, never here — layout, precedence, and the read path are the vegafactory-setup skill's `references/control-room.md`.

org: {{org}}

